<title>USA: TABLE - Coca-Cola Enterprises sells debt.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Coca-Cola Enterprises sells debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following three-tranche debt issue from Coca-Cola Enterprises was priced Tuesday, according to lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>Coca-Cola Enterprises is the world's largest soft drinks bottler.</p>
<p>BORROWER COCA-COLA ENTERPRISES</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.375 PCT  MATURITY 8/1/2001</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.883  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 6.408 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD +30 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>BORROWER COCA-COLA ENTERPRISES</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 6.625 PCT  MATURITY 8/1/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.887  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 6.645 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD +42 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 7.125 PCT  MATURITY 8/1/2017</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.786  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 7.145 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD +60 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
